  "groupId": "act18d0",
  "stageId": "act18d0_07",
  "title": "家園",
  "storyCode": "WD-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d0/level_act18d0_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2bb38fc9bbbff82d1208def4a777e0ba8c5b296e509273811eeee0fe5a3424a9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "5上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "二十二年前\n8:05 P.M.  天氣/多雲\n薩爾貢中部，伊巴特地區，沁礁鎮周邊"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_nobleN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......廢棄的庭院。這就是你們的家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幾年前，一位商人建起了這座富麗堂皇的庭院，他卻在一次行商旅途中，銷聲匿跡。是天災還是人禍，無人知曉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但至少這座庭院成了我們這些無家可歸者的庇護所。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無家可歸者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......老伊辛帶來了兩個新人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無家可歸者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而她的打扮可不像個窮人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫襤褸者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們該小心些......都回去屋裡吧，老伊辛的秘密不值得我們深究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這座庭院叫什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（薩爾貢語）“沉睡的薩爾貢”，流浪者都是這麼稱呼這裡的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如同我們的故土，女士。我們安眠在大地最奢華的屍體之上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請耐心等待天明，天明才能離開這裡，才能前往沁礁的中央。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "礁石環繞之地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的......在沙海的正中央。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕夏和王酋們選擇了資源更加豐富的地區重建城市，那是座被遺忘的舊址，一片無法之地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可對於過去生活在那座城市裡的人和他們的後代而言，那片土地是無法割捨的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您可以在那裡雇傭黑工和信使，他們會幫您偽造身份，順利離開薩爾貢的國境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但......您要去的地方實在是太遠太遠了，老伊辛可不敢保證您能安然抵達。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾利奧特還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他睡了，這裡很安全。您比我想像的還要關心他，這是您慈悲的象徵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果被他聽到你這麼說，他一定會生氣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，老伊辛看得見......看得見那孩子身上的憤怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩爾貢內亂與衝突頻發，我以為你看過的這類人並不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勇猛的復仇者並沒有世人所想的那般常見，他們大部分人都在仇恨中沉淪，在怒火中失去理智。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能救他這一命，也只能救他這一命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的......老伊辛知道，他的命運在別處......與您那枚金幣息息相關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼是二十二年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "法術做不到所謂“預言”，沒有凡人能擺弄時間——時間是命運之母，而老伊辛只是喜歡和時間打賭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說......唔，怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不悅的嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......多美的生物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老伊辛看得出，看得出你們相依而生，看得出......它是您的夥伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們共同走過了很長很長的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......去吧，Mon3tr，我們去見見他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦......交流......你們心靈相通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老伊辛能感覺到......感覺到您對這隻生物的信任，就彷彿它是你唯一的夥伴......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......您這般悠遠的旅途......您卻只和這隻美麗的生物一同？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，您的榮耀竟如此孤獨？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......孤獨與否並不會影響我的職責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "似乎有追兵，我去應對一下。你待在這裡，保護好艾利奧特。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，老伊辛有的是躲藏的辦法，老伊辛躲藏太多年啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_nobleD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_171_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敵人來襲，她與她信任的夥伴攜手共進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_171_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說那隻奇異的生物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_171_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你幹嘛盯著遠方？在擔心她嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，老伊辛不擔心。她的靈魂強韌而悠久，她使老伊辛相信，死亡都停不下她的旅途。所以老伊辛尊敬她，老伊辛想要詢問她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_171_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......問什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "百餘年了......老伊辛反覆做著同一個夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夢見黃沙之中的那座宏偉城市，城市會移動，從那裡眺望的天空是清澈的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年輕的帕夏就站在老伊辛身邊，面前是一望無際卻空無一物的土地。年輕的帕夏在訴說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但老伊辛聽不見。老伊辛忘記了。老伊辛罪無可赦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_171_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（又開始自言自語了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老伊辛一直在尋求這個答案。老伊辛一直在等待一個知曉那份榮耀，擁有那份知識的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有曾與那座城市有所牽連的人，都活在夢裡，有的人遺忘了，大部分人，依舊在懷念自己的故土......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我們用雙手在帕夏的帶領下建起了一座城市，一座偉大的城市，儘管天災毀去了它，但那座城市才是沁礁之地的伊始......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老伊辛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_173",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊巴特的薩爾貢人不該遺忘任何關於沁礁之城的片段......可......可老伊辛罪無可赦。老伊辛忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾利奧特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_171_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在等別人告訴你......你夢裡忘記的片段？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咆哮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "]"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那幾支小隊的領頭人......就是你，我對你有印象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是怎麼發現我們的，哥倫比亞人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......薩卡茲，我並不是哥倫比亞人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（薩卡茲某部族語言）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——唔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是什麼......你在影響我的心智？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放箭，打斷她施術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（薩卡茲某部族語言）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......最高規格的重箭也穿不透那隻怪物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情報果然太少，她似乎還是個術師，我們得小心些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......伊巴特王酋雇傭了你們，薩卡茲人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無可奉告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......伊巴特王酋因私仇痛恨維多利亞。也許我看走了眼，但剛才的箭矢確實是維多利亞的制式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來你們真正的雇主......現任帕夏穆拉的手腕比我想的要高明許多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一位富有耐心的統治者，遊刃有餘地挑撥各勢力間的關係。難道從一開始，哥倫比亞和當地王酋的種種計畫就被他盡收眼底？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚯，你明知道帕夏的存在，還膽敢在薩爾貢的土地上肆意妄為？真不知道你們這些哥倫比亞人在想什麼，腦子裡裝了源石嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "穆拉帕夏只需要回收那個箱子。交出箱子，我想我們可以相安無事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還沒有銷毀它，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為那不是我的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......嘴硬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊巴特王酋自以為是的行為已經招致了帕夏的怒火，無論是被何方雇傭的，那些哥倫比亞傭兵已經全部失去了作戰能力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這場無聊的爭鬥很快就會結束，而穆拉帕夏將終結這一切的執行權交給了我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倘若真是如此，為什麼高傲的薩爾貢帕夏要雇傭一群雇傭兵，而不是派他的親衛蕩平這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這畢竟牽扯到哥倫比亞的各種事情，但和現在的你無關，作出決定吧，行動顧問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只需知道，在這片沙漠中，如今你孤軍無援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（輕輕舒展身體）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......（警惕那個生物，完全不透明，很棘手。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（薩卡茲某部族語言）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不，不對，這不是簡單的法術——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說的是魔族語！？你這哥倫比亞人是怎麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（薩爾貢語）夠了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（薩爾貢語）用維多利亞語和薩爾貢語和我們交談，否則我會直接開火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們來自卡茲戴爾嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......卡茲戴爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那種騙孩子的傳說......雖然不知道你這術師和其他薩卡茲有什麼牽連，但這顯然和眼下的情形沒有關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爽快點吧，你打不打算交出那個箱子？帕夏要的只是那份技術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它會掀起薩爾貢滅亡的開端，穆拉帕夏並不是科學家，他無法理解這其中的損害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他不需要理解，我們也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......薩爾貢是你的故鄉嗎，薩卡茲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......從我記事開始，我就生活在薩爾貢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們在暗巷裡逃竄，藏起角，生活在最骯髒的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿起武器是我們吃飽飯的途徑，很簡單，我們幾乎是天生的感染者，不進則死，滿懷鬥志。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖——所以你要說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有意志堅定的薩卡茲才能免於古老語言的暗示，語言本身即是薩卡茲巫術的一種，你的意志來源於什麼？使命？或是貪婪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我得承認，也許你的暗示的確起效了，我到現在還沒有下令開火，甚至在耐著性子和你交談。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到的只是一個努力活著的薩卡茲。用他自以為最簡單的方式活著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（警覺地環顧四周）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夠了沒，哥倫比亞的傭兵頭子都這麼優柔寡斷嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "穆拉帕夏不會容忍薩卡茲人知曉他最骯髒的秘密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們堵截了所有參與爭奪戰的小隊，這其中何嘗沒有各大王酋偽裝成傭兵的部隊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你覺得在巨額貢稅和幾個薩卡茲殺手的性命之間，穆拉帕夏會選擇什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這點事我們當然清楚......那現在放你走，我們是能拿到更多的錢呢，還是可以立刻治好礦石病？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別搞錯了，我們是活在帕夏眼皮下的魔族佬。我們沒得選。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許我可以給你們選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（薩卡茲某部族語言）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——你試圖策反我們，然後呢，你要我們效忠——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——效忠一個我們連見都沒見過的......卡茲戴爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別開玩笑了，術師，薩卡茲的家園？那不過是一座座廢墟，大地上有多少座“卡茲戴爾”？你這種讀書人知道得應該更清楚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（讓術師準備好，集中火力對付那隻怪物，你們兩個，和我找機會做了那個女人。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遺憾，看來交涉決裂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這根本算不上交涉——嘁，你在憐憫我們？現在被包圍的人是你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實......你有很多值得忌憚的手段，但如果明天之前，我們沒有給帕夏合理的答覆，我們都難逃一死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像我一早說過的，我們沒得選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煙霧裡的......是那個怪物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......竟然能毫髮無損......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來自“卡茲戴爾”的術師，你又到底是什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "———"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你本可以不用淪為他人的工具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就想活著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且一直如此，當一個薩卡茲可不該有什麼遠大理想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拔劍，全隊突擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_003_kaltsn07",
      "aliases": [
        "凱爾希"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
